  "call": {
    "id": "call_1705000000_42_15",
    "caller_id": 42,
    "callee_id": 15,
    "call_type": "voice" | "video",
    "status": "ringing",
    "caller_name": "Jane Doe",
    "caller_username": "jane",
    "caller_avatar": "https://media.featheredsocial.site/profiles/jane.webp"
  }
}
```

Returns `{ "call": null }` (or `{}`) if no incoming call is ringing.

