## 10. Caches (client-side, no server calls)

| Cache | Key | What it stores | TTL |
|---|---|---|---|
| Messages | `unera_chat_msgs_v3_<userId>_<recipientId>` | Last 200 messages per conversation | No expiry |
| Conversation ID | `unera_chat_cid_v3_<userId>_<recipientId>` | `conversation_id` for the pair | No expiry |
| Conversations list | `unera_cached_convos_v2_<userId>` | Array of `ConversationRow` | No expiry, refreshed every 7s |
| Following | `unera_cached_following_v2_<userId>` | Array of `User` | No expiry |
| Attachments | `unera-chat-files-v1` (Cache API) | Downloaded files | Browser-managed |

These caches make Chat open **instantly** — no loading spinner when reopening a conversation, even offline.

